<title>USA: Tommy Hilfiger says Price Costco sells fakes.</title>
<headline>Tommy Hilfiger says Price Costco sells fakes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tommy Hilfiger Licensing Inc said Friday it filed legal documents alleging that Price Costco Canada has been selling counterfeit Tommy Hilfiger merchandise.</p>
<p>The company said it is seeking injunctive relief and damages in a Canadian court, an action prompted by Price Costco Canada's response to its cease and desist notice of March 11, which Hilfiger termed &quot;unsatisfactory.&quot;</p>
